  "description": "Foundation, maker of the Passport bitcoin wallet, warned customers about phishing emails sent from its own domain, some with buyers' real names and addresses, that pushed people to enter their recovery phrase; the company says funds and devices are safe. A real sender and your real details never make a request for your recovery phrase safe.\n\nEducational content, not financial advice.\n\n#crypto #cryptoscam #phishing #shorts",
